      "id": "kmutt-reunion-2023",
      "title": "The 8th Reunion Symposium of the KMUTT Fixed Point Lab",
      "date": "2023-12-15",
      "place": "Bangkok, Thailand",
      "caption": "Each December the KMUTT Fixed Point Theory and Applications Research Group gathers its members, past and present, for a two-day reunion symposium. At the eighth edition, held on 15–16 December 2023, Sani was invited to speak to the group that shaped his doctoral years, sharing recent results and the research directions they have opened.",
