      "id": "phd-defense-2023",
      "title": "Doctoral defence at KMUTT",
      "date": "2023-11-22",
      "place": "Bangkok, Thailand",
      "caption": "On 22 November 2023, Sani defended his doctoral thesis, Approximation Methods for Fixed Point and Convex Optimization Problems, before his advisors Prof. Poom Kumam, Assoc. Prof. Songpon Sriwongsa and Prof. Vasile Berinde. The examining committee also included Assoc. Prof. Parinya Sa Ngiamsunthorn, Dr. Parin Chaipunya and Dr. Konrawut Khammahawong, with Prof. Suthep Suantai presiding. These photographs mark the close of the defence and the people who saw the work through.",
