      "id": "icfpta-2023",
      "title": "ICFPTA 2023, Transilvania University of Brașov",
      "date": "2023-07-11",
      "place": "Brașov, Romania",
      "caption": "At the 14th International Conference on Fixed Point Theory and its Applications, hosted by the Faculty of Mathematics and Computer Science of Transilvania University of Brașov from 11 to 14 July 2023, Sani presented Variational Inequality and Proximal Point Scheme for Enriched Nonexpansive Mappings in CAT(0) Spaces. The conference brought together much of the fixed point community, and many of the conversations begun there continue in later joint work.",
