    {
      "id": "isim-2023",
      "title": "ISIM & ISWIM 2023, University POLITEHNICA of Bucharest",
      "date": "2023-06-28",
      "place": "Bucharest, Romania",
      "caption": "From 28 to 30 June 2023, Sani took part in the 2nd International Symposium and International Student Workshop on Interdisciplinary Mathematics, organised by University POLITEHNICA of Bucharest with the ‘Traian Lalescu’ Centre for Research and Training in Innovative Techniques of Applied Mathematics in Engineering (CiTi) and ‘1 Decembrie 1918’ University of Alba Iulia. He spoke on Nonexpansive-type Mappings with Viscosity Iteration in Hadamard Spaces and met researchers from many countries working at the meeting point of analysis and engineering.",
