    {
      "id": "bbu-seminar-2023",
      "title": "Seminar talk at Babeș–Bolyai University",
      "date": "2023-05-18",
      "place": "Cluj-Napoca, Romania",
      "caption": "On the morning of 18 May 2023, Sani addressed the Seminar on Nonlinear Operators and Differential Equations at Babeș–Bolyai University, a seminar series that has met without interruption since 1969. His talk, Geodesic Convexity in Fixed Point Theory, was attended by members of the Cluj school of fixed point theory, among them Prof. Ioan A. Rus, the doctoral advisor of Prof. Vasile Berinde, and drew generous and encouraging comments from the audience.",
