    {
      "id": "baia-mare-2023",
      "title": "Research visit to the North University Centre at Baia Mare",
      "date": "2023-04-15",
      "place": "Baia Mare, Romania",
      "caption": "Supported by an Erasmus+ mobility grant, Sani spent April to July 2023 at the North University Centre at Baia Mare, Technical University of Cluj-Napoca, as a guest of Prof. Vasile Berinde. Long working sessions on enriched mappings in geodesic spaces became the starting point of a collaboration that has since produced several joint papers, and time spent with Prof. Berinde's students and colleagues turned into lasting friendships.",
